# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# `rustfmt.toml` sets `newline_style = "Unix"` and CI runs `cargo fmt --check`, so CRLF files
# fail the build regardless of the contributor's platform. Enforcing it here stops the problem
# recurring on Windows checkouts rather than catching it in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
